1
00:00:00,451 --> 00:00:04,201
(Howard:)Hang on.
Are you saying the rest of us are dogs?

2
00:00:04,371 --> 00:00:06,791
l can see you're gonna
take this the wrong way.

3
00:00:06,957 --> 00:00:08,207
(Sheldon:)Let me try again.

4
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:10,465
lmagine
you're the sole human being...

5
00:00:10,628 --> 00:00:14,048
(Sheldon:)...living on a planet
populated with nothing but chimps.

6
00:00:14,215 --> 00:00:15,295
(Howard:)Get out of my lab.

7
00:00:15,466 --> 00:00:17,676
(Sheldon:)Oh, now,
they're so much smarter than dogs.

8
00:00:17,843 --> 00:00:20,303
(Sheldon:)Have you seen them
on those little bicycles?

9
00:00:20,471 --> 00:00:22,601
Get out!

10
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:25,644
- How about dolphins?
- Out!

11
00:00:27,937 --> 00:00:30,357
(Leonard:)So come on,
how was the first day with Hawking?

12
00:00:30,522 --> 00:00:32,902
(Howard:)It was great. We talked about movies.

13
00:00:33,067 --> 00:00:34,487
(Raj:)Oh.

14
00:00:35,319 --> 00:00:38,069
- l showed him some card tricks.
- Oh.

15
00:00:38,239 --> 00:00:40,489
(Howard:)He even let me read a couple pages
from his new book.

16
00:00:40,658 --> 00:00:42,618
(Raj:)Oh...

17
00:00:44,161 --> 00:00:46,911
(Howard:)Something got you down there,
bunky?

18
00:00:47,081 --> 00:00:50,081
(Sheldon:)Howard, please, I'm begging you.

19
00:00:50,251 --> 00:00:53,501
(Leonard:)Raj, you're our group historian.
Has Sheldon ever begged before?

20
00:00:53,671 --> 00:00:54,881
(Raj:)Three times.

21
00:00:55,047 --> 00:00:58,337
(Raj:)He begged the Fox network
not to cancel Firefly.

22
00:00:58,926 --> 00:01:04,026
(Raj:)He begged the TNT network
to cancel Babylon 5.

